# Trivy misconfiguration ignores for chrono-synth-deploy.
#
# Each entry is a finding ID followed by a rationale. Reviewers should
# verify the rationale still applies when downstream code changes.

# AWS-0104: terraform-aws-modules/eks/aws worker-node security group
# egress 0.0.0.0/0. Necessary because nodes must reach the public
# internet for image pulls, AWS API endpoints, and OS updates via the
# NAT gateway. Workload-level egress restrictions are enforced by
# Kyverno + Cilium at the pod layer; the SG rule is plumbing.
AVD-AWS-0104
